From 97fa7d1ac5b2dda944179aeebb0ae791ec30e969 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Asmitha Karunanithi <asmitk01@in.ibm.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Feb 2025 11:31:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add PCIeSlots Redfish Endpoint for Chassis

This commit introduces support for retrieving PCIe slot information
from the inventory and exposing it via the /Chassis/<id>/PCIeSlots
Redfish endpoint.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Tested By:
'''
GET https://${bmc}/redfish/v1/Chassis/<ChassisId>
    "PCIeSlots": {
        "@odata.id": "/redfish/v1/Chassis/IBM_System1_Baseboard/PCIeSlots"
    }

GET https://${bmc}/redfish/v1/Chassis/<ChassisId>/PCIeSlots
    "Slots": [
        {
          "Lanes": 4,
          "Location": {
            "PartLocation": {
              "ServiceLabel": "..."
            }
          },
          "PCIeType": "...",
          "SlotType": "...",
          "Status": {
            "State": "<Enabled/Absent>"
          }
        },
        {...}
    ]
'''

Change-Id: If9200559359c721aa67775d65f2dc9d3bf51a079
Signed-off-by: Asmitha Karunanithi <asmitk01@in.ibm.com>
